1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Władimir Wałoc Trubecki''' (October 5, 1915, Reval - April 22, 1997, Tallinn) was a member of the Trubetsky princely family. Son of Paweł Trubecki. During World War II, he served in the Armia Krajowa, in Wilno V
2 CONC oivodeship, the armed partisan organisation in Poland during the World War II and in the period following it. He was married twice: the first time to Gertrud Emilie Tiksmann (born December 11, 1917, Narva), the second time to Lydi
2 CONC a Maripuu (January 25, 1915, Dundaga - April 25, 1990, Muuga Aedlinn). He had three children - sons Jaan (December 29, 1938, Tallinn - February 9, 2013, Tallinn), and Erich (born May 28, 1941, Tallinn), and a daughter Isabella (bo
2 CONC rn July 20, 1956, Offenbach, wife of Reiner Hitzel). 
2 CONT
